# Content & calibration

- Items live as reviewed Git JSON — no ad-hoc SQL inserts for banks.
- Every item needs `competency_id`, `real_world_weight`, `difficulty_tag`, model answer.
- Weights must sum to 1.0 per track/level — enforce in `content-pipeline validate`.
- Parallel forms + exposure/retirement live in `catalog`; assessment never queries `items` raw.
- Cut scores = Angoff μ±σ from panels; never hardcode Gold/Silver/Bronze thresholds in eval code.
- "Validated lead" requires recorded panel + Cronbach's α ≥ 0.70.
